# Design system

Dark, minimal, editorial. Reference points: Linear, Vercel dashboard, Mercury.
A financial tool — precise and quiet, never playful.

## Tokens (CSS variables in globals.css, mapped in tailwind.config.ts)
--bg: #0A0A0A            --surface: #121212
--surface-raised: #171717 --surface-hover: #1C1C1C
--border: #222222        --border-strong: #2E2E2E
--text: #EDEDED          --text-muted: #9E9E9E   --text-faint: #6B6B6B
--accent: #E8890C        --accent-hover: #F59E1B
--accent-fg: #0A0A0A     --accent-subtle: rgba(232,137,12,0.10)
--danger: #E5484D        --warn: #F5A623  --success: #30A46C  --info: #5B8DEF

NEVER use raw hex in components. Tokens only.

## Rules
- The accent appears fewer than six times per screen. Overdue amounts use
  --danger, not accent. Accent is for actions; red is for problems.
- Inter via next/font. Weights 400, 500, 600 only.
- Page title 20/600/-0.02em. Body 14/400. Table cell 13/400.
  Label 12/500/uppercase/0.04em. Metric 28/600/tabular-nums.
- ALL numbers use font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums.
- Currency: Intl.NumberFormat('en-IN') for INR — lakh grouping (₹4,82,000),
  not thousands. Never abbreviate in tables.
- 240px sidebar, content max-width 1400px, 8px spacing scale, 6px radius
  (8px on modals). Table rows 44px, 12px horizontal cell padding.
- Motion: 150ms ease-out on hover/focus, 200ms on panel slide. Nothing else.
- Icons: Lucide, thin stroke, 16px, --text-muted, never accent-colored.

## Never use
Gradients. Glassmorphism or backdrop blur. Colored glows. Emoji as icons.
Filled or duotone icons. More than one accent color. Decorative dividers.
Pill badges scattered through copy. Animated borders. Anything that exists
purely to fill space.

Test: if a screen could be a page in a well-designed annual report, it's
right. If it looks like a SaaS template, strip it back.
